        {
          "text": "Thumani amadoda enu ukuze ahlole ilizwe laseKhanani engilinika abantwana bakoIsrayeli; kuzo zonke izizwe zoyise wothuma indoda ibe nye, kube yilowo nalowo abe yisikhulu phakathi kwabo.",
